      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Still happening on worlds 3.10.3. Client's entire project is nearly-unusable, as every edit to any component on any prefab causes this error, for which the only workaround is to select a different prefab and then select the prefab again to fix the component in inspector. For example, unchecking \"Use Gravity\" on a rigidbody on a prefab that also has an udonsharp script causes the rigidbody component to be uneditable (\"minimized\"). I can't find any reason that this has occurred. There is nothing in common between the udonsharp scripts, other than having public variables. If I find any solution I will post it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
